  "price_note": "ESTIMATE, parts only. Raspberry Pi Zero W or Zero 2 W ~$15-25, Waveshare 2.13in e-Paper HAT ~$25-30 (v2 and v4 are the tested revisions - buy the right one, the panel revisions are not interchangeable), microSD 16GB+ ~$8, USB power bank or LiPo HAT ~$12-20, case ~$10. Realistic all-in $70-90. It needs an Ethernet or Wi-Fi route onto the target LAN, so on a Pi Zero W add a USB Ethernet adapter ~$8 if you want to plug it in.",
