  "research_gaps": [
   "Whether the firmware borrows from ESP32 Marauder, Bruce or Ghost ESP cannot be determined - there is no source to compare, and Marauder ships no ESP32-C3 build at all while Ghost ESP's C3 build has not been updated since March 2025. The feature set (ESP-NOW mesh, arcade games, IR suite, Rust SDK) has no obvious counterpart in any of them.",
   "A third-party Ghidra analysis of the old v0.8 binary (domseguna/BLEShark-Firmware-Analysis) claims no OTA signature verification and a hardcoded fake Google login page. It is one person's unreviewed work against a firmware version that predates the current OTA mechanism - unverified, and not treated as fact here.",
   "No independent teardown or written review found; Hackaday.io coverage is vendor-authored",
   "Real battery life under load is unverified and the vendor's own estimate has been revised down over time"
  ]
