  "firmware_note": "The Bruce project's own devkit, designed so that Bruce's whole feature list works natively instead of needing bolt-on modules. This is the board where Bruce's sub-GHz, NFC and NRF24 menus are real.",
  "vendor": "Elecrow (for the Bruce project)",
  "vendor_url": "https://bruce.computer/boards",
  "product_url": "https://www.elecrow.com/bruce-pcb-rf-reaper.html",
