  "firmware_note": "A fork of the official emsec ChameleonMini RevG firmware, adding Android and iOS apps, on-device MFKEY32 cracking, better power management and battery indication, improved RF field performance, and magic-card UID/SAK modes. Last commit on the proxgrind branch was June 2023. RfidResearchGroup ChameleonMini fork (proxgrind branch)",
