   "mcu_primary_note": "ARM Cortex-M4F at 64 MHz, 1MB flash, 256KB RAM, BLE 5.0 and USB 2.0. Its on-die NFC-A tag peripheral does HF card emulation autonomously at ~5mA/3.3V without waking the CPU, which is where the six-month battery figure comes from.",
