    "v": "yes",
    "note": "EM410x, T5577, HID Prox, Indala, FDX-B, Paradox, AWID, PAC/Stanley, Viking, Keri, Securakey, Gallagher, and (added in v2.2.0) ioProx, EM4x05/EM4x69, IDTECK PSK1 and Jablotron. All of these are unauthenticated by design - the card shouts its ID at anything that powers it."
