  "legal": {
   "import_restricted": [],
   "risk_level": "high",
   "notes": "Owning it is legal in most places. Transmitting on sub-GHz bands without a licence or outside permitted power and duty-cycle limits is an offence in most countries, and the dual-radio jamming techniques the hardware enables fall under the FCC's flat prohibition on jammer operation (47 U.S.C. 302a and 333). Opening a vehicle or garage you do not own is a separate and much more serious matter. MouseJack keystroke injection is unauthorised access. Check your local law; this is not legal advice."
  },
