   "battery_mah": 2100,
   "battery_note": "Li-Po. The firmware's fuel-gauge config (targets/f7/furi_hal/furi_hal_power_config.c) programs design capacity 2100 mAh; some spec sheets quote the cell as 2000 mAh nominal. Roughly a week idle, about a day of heavy RF use.",
   "charging": "USB-C",
