  "honest_take": "This is a dead project and you should not install it - it is here so people who find old tutorials and YouTube videos know what happened to it. It did not vanish because it was bad; the same developers carried the work forward into Momentum, which is explicitly described in Momentum's README as 'a direct continuation of the Xtreme firmware'. Interestingly, Xtreme's own archived README points users to Unleashed rather than Momentum. Anything you liked about Xtreme exists in Momentum today.",
