  "price_note": "Estimate for a bare ESP32 dev board - a WROOM-32U module board is $8.50 at one of the Marauder vendor's own listings, and generic ESP32/ESP32-S3 dev boards run roughly $5-15. The firmware is free but no longer maintained.",
  "price_is_estimate": true,
  "price_checked": "2026-09-06",
  "skill_level": "intermediate",
  "skill_note": "You must pick a matching build from the final release zip set, flash it with esptool, and accept that nothing will ever be fixed.",
