   "mcu_secondary": "STM32G431CBU6",
   "mcu_secondary_note": "Cortex-M4 at up to 170MHz. It handles power sequencing, battery status and the compatibility shim that lets unmodified Flipper Zero firmware run on this board, with its own firmware repo and its own DFU and SWD path.",
