  "honest_take": "NEMO is refreshingly honest about being small: the author says outright he has no delusions of superseding anything. It has NO deauth attack - the source contains only deauth_hunter.h, a detector - so anyone buying it expecting a Wi-Fi weapon has misread it. Its real value is the defensive half: BLE Hunter, Deauth Hunter, PineAP Hunter and BadUSB Hunter tell you when you are being attacked, which almost nothing else in this category does. Be aware the offensive half is ageing badly - the README itself notes Apple has patched much of the BLE spam since 2023. On this board there is also no SD slot, so portal credentials have nowhere to go, and no GPS.",
