    "note": "ELITE TIER ONLY, and narrower than it sounds: it logs Full-Speed (12 Mbps) USB keyboards only - not Low-Speed or High-Speed ones - wired as host to O.MG-active to O.MG-passive to keyboard. Roughly 650,000 keystrokes of storage. Mischief Gadgets publishes a verified-keyboard list (Apple Magic Keyboard, Keychron K1/K6, Drop CTRL and others). Basic-tier cables have no keylogger."
