    "note": "O.MG runs its OWN standalone Python C2 server, shipped in the firmware repository - it is NOT Hak5 Cloud C2 and O.MG devices do not appear in Hak5's Cloud C2 device list. It is an asynchronous polling relay, not a real-time shell, encrypted with MonoCypher over plain HTTP so it survives content inspection. Elite tier only."
