  "firmware_note": "The maintained fork. The original evilsocket repo's last tagged release was v1.5.5 in April 2021 and its last real code commit was October 2024 - if you follow a tutorial that points at evilsocket/pwnagotchi, you are following a dead path.",
  "vendor": "Community project (evilsocket originally; jayofelony maintains)",
