  "price_note": "ESTIMATE, parts only, for the handheld Pi build: Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W ~$18-25, microSD ~$8, display and battery depending on the chassis you pick ~$25-40. But the honest answer is that the cost depends entirely on which build you choose - it also runs on a Wi-Fi Pineapple Pager or a Hackberry Pi CM5, and its heavier features (OWASP ZAP) want 8GB+ RAM, which no Pi Zero has. On an existing Debian server or in Docker the hardware cost is zero.",
