   "notes": "Plugging an unauthorised device into an organisation's network and scanning it is unauthorised access under computer-misuse law in most countries, and port scanning specifically has been prosecuted. The fact that the device is designed for speed and concealment does not help you legally. Get written authorisation naming the site before you touch a jack."
