  "firmware_note": "Replaces the dongle's Zigbee coordinator firmware entirely and turns a $20 smart-home accessory into the best cheap BLE sniffer available.",
  "vendor": "ITEAD/SONOFF (hardware); NCC Group (Sniffle firmware)",
