  "price_note": "$173.25 on Tindie, in stock 2026-09-06. EUR139.99 direct from wiredhatters.com (~$164). Includes the PCB, a 3D-printed case, two external 2.4 GHz antennas, an internal ceramic GPS antenna and screws. Note the contradiction: older coverage says both chips ship pre-flashed with Marauder, while the vendor's own page says it ships with no firmware 'due to legal reasons' - assume you are flashing it.",
