  "firmware_note": "Two firmwares that talk over I2C: one on the ATmega32u4 that presents the USB keyboard, one on the ESP8266 that serves the web interface. The newest release is still a release candidate from January 2022.",
  "vendor": "Community project (Spacehuhn Technologies)",
