   "notes": "Owning and building it is legal. Plugging it into a computer you do not own and injecting keystrokes is unauthorised access under the CFAA in the US, the Computer Misuse Act in the UK, and equivalents elsewhere - the fact that it types rather than exploits makes no legal difference. Check your local law; this is not legal advice."
