  "price_note": "Vendor lists EUR129.85; ~$152 converted at 1.17 USD/EUR on 2026-09-06. Ships as a limited batch of 45. The AirLeak Mini is EUR109.85 (~$129) and drops the GPS header and the 18650 for a JST LiPo. The older ESP32-S3 HID/BadUSB line is much cheaper: Kit EUR19.85, Dongle EUR34.85, USBLogger EUR54.85, Echo EUR64.85.",
